WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:10.380
The average thickness of ice in Antarctica
is about 1 mile.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.759
The farther a cat falls, the better.

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:17.390
Cats are less likely to be injured if they
fall from greater heights.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:23.590
When cats fall from 5 stories of higher they
reach terminal velocity and relax their bodies,

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:27.560
which slows them down and protects them from
the impact.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:34.370
New Zealand will deny people residency visa's
if they too high of a BMI and there are cases

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:38.160
where people have been rejected because of
their weight.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:43.050
Abraham Lincoln kept his important documents
inside his hat.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:48.870
The world's most expensive phone number is
666-6666.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:54.149
It was sold in 2006 for £1.5 million.

00:00:54.149 --> 00:01:00.889
In ancient Rome, men found guilty of rape
had their testicles crushed between two stones.

00:01:00.889 --> 00:01:06.229
When building the Golden Gate Bridge, the
lead structural engineer insisted on the installation

00:01:06.229 --> 00:01:12.620
of a safety net even though its $130,000 cost
was deemed exorbitant.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:19.210
Over the four years of its construction, the
net saved 19 men from certain death, who named

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.770
themselves the “Halfway to Hell Club”.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:29.049
A physicist made his cat the co-author of
his scientific paper to avoid using “I”

00:01:29.049 --> 00:01:32.010
instead of “we” throughout the paper.

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:37.979
An elephant's trunk has no bones but 40,000
muscles.

00:01:37.979 --> 00:01:45.000
Cat kidneys are so efficient they can rehydrate
by drinking seawater.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.810
The law enforcement in a town in Northern
Spain has ordered that all prostitutes in

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:56.500
the town wear reflective vests whilst working,
to avoid traffic accidents at night.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:02.979
Before the holocaust Hitler gave the US, the
UK and many other nations the chance to take

00:02:02.979 --> 00:02:07.390
in jewish refugees, but they all refused.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:12.370
Every Panda in the world is on loan from China.

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:18.480
The logo of the New Zealand Air Force is the
Kiwi, a flightless bird.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:24.620
After working out, it takes 5 hours for your
body temperature to return to normal.

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:31.950
India's “Go Air” airline only hires female
flight attendants because they are lighter,

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:41.190
so they save up to $500,000 per year in fuel.

